<title>GERMANY: Bundesbank details M3 developments in November.</title>
<headline>Bundesbank details M3 developments in November.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bundesbank published the following data relating to M3 money supply in November.</p>
<p>    AGGREGATE (in bln marks)     Nov    Oct  Nov95  End96</p>
<p>								    Level</p>
<p>1) BANK LENDING TO DOMESTIC</p>
<p>   NON-BANKS (total)		+51.3  +46.0 +45.1  4,732.0</p>
<p>   Lending by Bundesbank	   0.0    0.0   0.0	8.7</p>
<p>   Lending by banks		 +51.3  +46.0 +45.1  4,723.3</p>
<p>    To firms and individuals    +28.2  +16.7 +25.5  3,553.9</p>
<p>of which</p>
<p>    short term lending	     0.0  - 1.1  -0.3    593.6</p>
<p>    To public authorities	 +23.1  +29.3 +19.5  1,169.4</p>
<p>2) NET EXTERNAL ASSETS</p>
<p>OF CREDIT INSTITUTIONS</p>
<p>   AND THE BUNDESBANK	     + 0.5  - 9.8 +15.2    295.5</p>
<p>3) MONETARY CAPITAL FORMATION</p>
<p>FROM DOMESTIC SOURCES, TOTAL +17.5  + 8.9 + 6.2  2,730.2</p>
<p>of which</p>
<p>Time deposits</p>
<p>    4 yrs and more		  + 5.5  + 4.3 + 5.9    791.3</p>
<p>Savings deposits over 3 mths</p>
<p>    notice, savings certificates +0.5  + 0.7 + 0.9    500.2</p>
<p>Bank debt securities</p>
<p>    in circulation		  + 9.6  + 2.6 - 2.3  1,106.1</p>
<p>4) DEPOSITS OF FED. GOVT.</p>
<p>   IN BANKING SYSTEM		+ 0.6  + 0.1 + 1.0	1.1</p>
<p> 5) OTHER FACTORS		   - 3.5  +16.7 + 8.0    209.9</p>
<p> 6) MONEY STOCK M3		  +37.2  +10.5 +45.1  2,086.4</p>
<p>    Currency in circulation     + 3.3  + 1.0 + 5.0x   244.5</p>
<p>    Sight deposits		  +37.7  +10.5 +40.4    617.7</p>
<p>    Time deposits up to 4 yrs   - 9.6  + 7.7 - 9.7    390.4</p>
<p>Savings deposits at</p>
<p>    three months notice	   + 5.9  + 6.7 + 9.4    833.9</p>
<p>SEASONALLY ADJUSTED DATA</p>
<p>Money M3, monthly average</p>
<p> Annual change from Q4 1995 (%) + 8.0  + 8.4	  2,059.4</p>
<p>Annual change over past</p>
<p>six months (%)</p>
<p>   M3 aggregate		     - 5.5  + 6.2</p>
<p>   M2 aggregate		     - 0.9  + 2.8	  1,218.7</p>
<p>   M1 aggregate		     + 5.2  +10.7	    821.0</p>
<p>   M3 extended				 + 3.1</p>
<p>Lending to firms</p>
<p>    and individuals		 + 5.9  + 5.6	  3,554.6</p>
<p>   Monetary capital formation   + 5.4  + 5.2	  2,740.2</p>
